+## 🆕 VWMA 17 Strategy (Fork Addition)
+
+This fork adds the **VWMA 17 strategy** — the first strategy supporting both long and short positions with ATR-based stop loss and take profit.
+
+**Entry:** Close crosses above VWMA(17) → Long | Close crosses below VWMA(17) → Short
+**Exit:** ATR-based stop loss (1.5x) and take profit (2.0x)
+
+```bash
+# Backtest via MCP tool
+backtest_strategy(symbol="BTC-USD", strategy="vwma17", period="2y")
+
+# Or run standalone
+python strategies/vwma17_strategy.py --symbol BTC-USD --period 2y
+```
+
+The `strategies/` directory contains paired files — same strategy name, different extensions:
+- `vwma17_strategy.py` — Standalone Python backtester
+- `vwma17_strategy.pine` — TradingView Pine Script v6
+
